Modifications by Jeongung Heo include explicit source-owned native
registration/bridges, package-specific native lookup, guarded S3 dispatch,
documentation and package tests, as well as full recursive prior, strict admissibility,
midpoint/hold/failure cutpoint proposals, target-consistent birth/death, DART
terminal correction, and full-prior depth-hyperparameter updates. These are
modifications to the inherited sampler, not a claim of upstream equivalence.
All inherited copyright notices remain. GPL (>= 2) applies.

The public 1.0.1 distribution identifies Jeongung Heo as the author and
